 I always complete the mines before the quest, and I usually wind up
clearing the castle before the quest, too. As for the Gnomish Mines,
I wait until I have a good character (level 6 or 7), around 50 hp, 
and an armor class of at least 2. I'll explore the main dungeon until
level 7 or so, at which point the game gets too hard and I head for the
mines. Look for shops in the main dungeon, there is a mine town level
in the Mines, but there isn't a lot of stuff there. Neutral and lawful
characters have it easier in the Mines, chaotics have to fight dwarves
and gnomes, so they should be more powerful when they start the Mines.
Don't forget the luckstone at the bottom, it's very valuable.

